    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Jeremy Murphy & Associates are delighted to bring to the market this three-bedroom mid-terrace property located in the heart of Douglas Village. 18 Douglas West, Douglas, Cork T12 P7F8\r\n\r\nThis vibrant area boasts an excellent selection of amenities, including two major shopping centres Douglas Village Shopping Centre and Douglas Court Shopping Centre offering a variety of retail stores, supermarkets, cafés, and restaurants. Food lovers will appreciate the abundance of dining options, from cosy coffee shops to fine dining experiences. The area is well-served by public transport, with regular bus routes connecting Douglas to Cork city centre in under 15 minutes. Additionally, the N40 South Ring Road is easily accessible, ensuring smooth commutes to other parts of the city and beyond.\r\n\r\nViewing is Highly Advised to Fully Appreciate!\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, living room, Kitchen, One Bathroom ,and three\r\nbedrooms.\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALLWAY 0.85m x 4.32m\r\nA PVC door with glazed panels leads into the entrance hallway. The entrance hallway comprises of fitted carpeted flooring, one Centre light and one radiator.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM 2.33m x 4.35m\r\nThis bright and spacious living room comprises carpeted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the front of the property. The room also benefits from a feature open fireplace with a stunning tiled surround.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING 3.35m x 3.54m\r\nKITCHEN AREA\r\nThis kitchen benefits from tiled flooring, one window overlooking the rear garden, one centre light, one radiator The kitchen also benefits from a range of fitted kitchen units with a contrasting countertop and splashback tiles. The kitchen incorporates a stainless-steel sink with a draining board, an integrated fridge freezer and plumbing for a washing machine. There is a built-in oven with a four-ring induction hob and an extractor fan located above. A solid timber door leads out to the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nMAIN BATHROOM 1.72m x 1.76m\r\nThree-piece bathroom suite incorporating a shower with an electric attachment, wash hand basin and wc. The main bathroom has lino flooring, one window overlooking the side of the property along with one centre light, one extractor fan and one radiator.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 2.75m x 2.25m\r\nThis bedroom features carpeted fitted flooring, one centre light, one radiator, and one window overlooking the front of the property.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2 2.74m x 2.00m\r\nThis bedroom features carpeted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window with frosted glass panelling overlooking Bedroom One.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3 3.62m x 2.27m\r\nThis bedroom features carpeted flooring, one centre light, one radiator and one window overlooking the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nREAR OF PROPERTY\r\nThis property is laid to lawn with plenty of space for outdoor furniture. This garden would be an ideal place for entertaining during the summer months."
      },
